# Stills and player logs stay on the machine that ran them (a cycle writes ~50 MB of PNG). The JSON reports,
# args and patches are the record; a still that matters to a card is named in the ledger by run label.
*.png
*.log

# bench.sh and player_bench.sh write hand runs here (TW_BENCH_OUT overrides); only a cycle's
# numbered folder is the record.
manual/
